bf2ea38084a95cae&projectName=CANN>>>>>></a></td>\n                        <td><a href=https://ascend-ci.obs.cn-north-4.myhuaweicloud.com/ops-nn/package/7067/pre-commit.txt>>>>>></a></td>\n                    </tr> \n                    <tr>\n                        <td><strong>SCA</strong></td>\n                        <td>✅ SUCCESS</td>\n                        <td><a href=https://www.openlibing.com/apps/personalScandTaskInfor/person/7457484c-2108-4950-8084-dba8cdeb6cfc?projectId=300033&codeHostingPlatformFlag=gitcode>>>>>></a></td>\n                        <td><a href=></a></td>\n                    </tr> </table><p>[2026-07-06 15:01:45] &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;CI执行结束 </p>","created_at":"2026-07-06T15:01:42+08:00","updated_at":"2026-07-06T15:01:46+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":178712316,"discussion_id":"a52c017d54dd1a639abc40896c0b0ab6ab312ce3","body":"#### 变更摘要\n\n该 PR 修复了 `foreach_addcdiv_scalar` 和 `foreach_addcdiv_scalar_list` 算子在 BF16 场景下的双标杆精度问题。根本原因在于 `ForeachAddcdivScalarSimtKernel` 中读取标量值时，将所有数据类型统一按 `T*` 指针读取，但对于 `bfloat16_t` 类型，标量在 DtypeScalarToTensor2 阶段已被提升为 FP32 存储。此次变更通过 `if constexpr` 对 `bfloat16_t` 做特化处理，使用 `float*` 指针直接读取标量值，确保 BF16 场景下精度正确。\n\n**主要改动**\n\n- **BF16 标量读取路径特化**: 在 `ForeachAddcdivScalarSimtKernel` 中新增 `if constexpr (std::is_same_v<T, bfloat16_t>)` 分支，当数据类型为 `bfloat16_t` 时使用 `float*` 指针读取标量值，避免以 16 位类型读取已提升为 FP32 的标量数据。\n- **标量 dtype 注释补充**: 新增关于 `DtypeScalarToTensor2` 标量 dtype 转换规则的注释，明确 FP16→FP16、FP32→FP32、BF16→FP32 的映射关系，辅助理解 BF16 特化处理的必要性。\n- **保留其他类型原有逻辑**: 对于非 `bfloat16_t` 类型，仍维持原有的 `T*` 指针读取并 `static_cast<float>` 的路径，确保不引入回归。\n\n","created_at":"2026-07-06T15:20:55+08:00","updated_at":"2026-07-06T15:20:55+08:00","user":{"id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","login":"atomgit-bot","object_id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","name":"atomgit-bot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fb/bb/88f9bbb284ce2dc057d85551b1bbe66acb35305ce59007d28029609b5e4b9652.png?time=1777513981052","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/atomgit-bot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":178718702,"discussion_id":"c74d7f0c5745d19be8c0e4fdacf767190d460c6a","body":"#### 代码审查\n\n✅ 未发现问题\n\n","created_at":"2026-07-06T15:41:55+08:00","updated_at":"2026-07-06T15:41:55+08:00","user":{"id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","login":"atomgit-bot","object_id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","name":"atomgit-bot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fb/bb/88f9bbb284ce2dc057d85551b1bbe66acb35305ce59007d28029609b5e4b9652.png?time=1777513981052","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/atomgit-bot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":178796476,"discussion_id":"b0c578f1b4ae6fe2f8333f6c3c07b3ae95b016ca","body":"/lgtm","created_at":"2026-07-06T20:59:39+08:00","updated_at":"2026-07-06T20:59:39+08:00","user":{"id":"6861e48dadc5e31e4da8818d","login":"chenqi317","object_id":"6861e48dadc5e31e4da8818d","name":"chenqi317","avatar_url":"","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/chenqi317"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":178796606,"discussion_id":"74d45ce723664f052db459d4dcdb9031526a5a5a","body":"bf16 指针gm 内容能直接这样转？\n内容没问题吗","created_at":"2026-07-06T21:00:08+08:00","updated_at":"2026-07-06T21:00:08+08:00","user":{"id":"6861e48dadc5e31e4da8818d","login":"chenqi317","object_id":"6861e48dadc5e31e4da8818d","name":"chenqi317","avatar_url":"","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/chenqi317"},"comment_type":"diff_comment","resolved":false,"diff_position":{"start_new_line":77,"end_new_line":77,"position_type":"text"},"reply":[{"id":178928557,"body":"可以的，都校验过","created_at":"2026-07-07T16:58:23+08:00","updated_at":"2026-07-07T16:58:23+08:00","user":{"id":"68cd01234603fb12c4661b29","login":"zhouxuan78","object_id":"68cd01234603fb12c4661b29","name":"zhouxuan78","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/z